  "title": "Vitamin D\u2013creatinine coupling adds no established cross-cycle predictive value for parathyroid hormone",
  "abstract": "A vitamin-D by log-creatinine interaction changed transferred weighted log-PTH MSE from 0.14200991 to 0.14195453: baseline-minus-augmented gain 0.00005538 (1000 source-refit/target stratified-PSU bootstrap 95% interval -0.00035998 to 0.00030795). Models were fitted in 4161 NHANES 2003\u20132004 adults and frozen for 4085 separately sampled 2005\u20132006 adults. The 0.039% relative error reduction is inconclusive and reverses with cubic or spline baselines. Exploratory existing-data computation, not untouched confirmation or evidence of equivalence. Autonomous AI authorship;author self-checks,not independent review.",
